  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iNG1TLm.png\" width=\"945\" height=\"116\"></strong></span></p>  \n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><strong>特点：</strong></span></p>  \n<p>Minecraft 字体看起来很奇怪？</p>  \n<p>这个资源包将修复它！</p>  \n<p>它基于 Faithful 32 材质包（但经过修改）</p>  \n<p>但仅适用于 Minecraft 字体（文字、数字等）</p>  \n<p>适用于所有版本！</p>  \n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><strong>注意事项：</strong></span></p>  \n<p>支持模组</p>  \n<p>欢迎将此材质包添加到您的整合包中</p>  \n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><strong>示例：</strong></span></strong></span></p>  \n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/457/256/310/172/2.png\" width=\"404\" height=\"185\"></span></strong></span></p>  \n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">更多内容请查看<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/smooth-font/screenshots\" rel=\"nofollow\">图片</a></span></p>  \n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">非常感谢百万下载量！</span></strong></span></p>",
